  "description": "Riding their first pedal bike is a big deal, so we designed Koda to prepare them for a lifetime of adventures. With comfortable, kid-centric ergonomics, this kids bike has the perfect proportions for easy and safe handling. Its wide range of adjustable height can accommodate little riders and their big growth spurts. The bike’s equipped with powerful V-brakes and an adjustable-reach lever for small hands to comfortably grip, teaching them early how to use hand brakes. With a minimum seat height of just 15.5”, Koda is able to accommodate smaller kids than most and is ready to grow with them, so they can start early and keep riding comfortably.",
